		{"text"},
		line=1484,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030190"},
		line=1484,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Has the chairman prevailed against Okonogi yet, I wonder?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Knowing Hotori-sama, surely by now...”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"In the courtyard, Mutsumi's Shiseikan forces stand on alert for an enemy counterattack.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades' plans were to swiftly eliminate Okonogi and withdraw to Iseya before the Republican Army could mobilize a response.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The fox ears atop Koyuzu's head give off a twitch.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The effects of her spellblade amplify her hearing far beyond the capabilities of an ordinary person.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“This sound... Attack aircraft?!”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"That is all the warning Mutsumi needs to sense the imminent danger.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Incoming airstrike! All forces, take cover! Now!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Before Mutsumi's voice even manages to echo across the courtyard, a streak of light races across the sky above the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The palace is shaken by a terrible rumbling loud enough to herald the end of the world to all those caught within its vicinity.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Several of Mutsumi's warriors who failed to react in time are reduced to lifeless heaps of flesh before her very eyes.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"─Why are there attack aircraft? Did the Republican carrier not sail away already?!",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She forces herself to push aside such pointless questions. What she needs to do is to take cover, now!",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Twice, thrice more, the earth shakes.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Chunks of rubble and flesh rain down upon the hapless warriors scattered across the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Even so, the warriors do not sustain heavy casualties.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Koyuzu's sharp ears and Mutsumi's incisive commands managed to avert a much worse disaster.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Sarashina-sama, the Republican Army approaches!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“They number at least one hundred!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Your ears are truly incredible.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Mutsumi elegantly rises from her prone position on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"The rest of the warriors immediately follow her lead.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Even seasoned soldiers, despite being uninjured, would have been incapacitated by shell shock for some time.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Yet, every last warrior has naught but a smile on their face.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It's been three years since I last felt this thrill...”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Mutsumi's keen eyes fall upon a column of troop transports emerging from the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"One after another, Republican soldiers rush out of them and begin to form ranks.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Koyuzu-sama, please keep yourself hidden.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now then...”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Let us teach these heathens of the Shiseikan's bladesmanship.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Mutsumi leaps forward, straight into the waiting jaws of the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"The intervening space is filled at once with deadly bullets.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You fellows have not learned a single thing since three years ago, have you?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"But it is not her fellow warriors who hear Mutsumi's exasperated observation.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"It is instead the Republican soldiers, still blindly firing away into the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Mutsumi has infiltrated their ranks within the blink of an eye.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Prepare yourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The five enemy soldiers surrounding Mutsumi tumble backwards through the air.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Not a single one of them can figure out why they fell over.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"It is said that when cut by a true master of the blade, the pain will take some time to manifest.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The fallen soldiers are living proof, only filling the air with their wretched screams after several seconds of staring at their missing legs.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“The taller they come, the harder they fall.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Fast as the wind, Mutsumi slinks across the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Her faithful spellblade, ",
{"ruby", text="Haze"},
"Kasumi",
{"/ruby"},
", allows its wielder to meld away into the background.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"On top of that, the dim light of the moon is all that illuminates the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The Republican soldiers are scarcely able to catch even a glimpse of her shadow.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Helpless to resist, the soldiers' legs are mercilessly cut out from beneath them.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"In the very next moment, the field is rife with the desolate screams of dying men.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"The armored vehicles begin indiscriminately opening fire.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The friendly soldiers caught in the explosions are sent tumbling across the ground in flames.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"In less than a single minute, seventy percent of the entire enemy company was dispatched of.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Their captain in the back lines was also cut down by Mutsumi at some point.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"They've completely ceased to function as a fighting unit.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"A single soldier's desperate scream serves as the signal for a retreat which immediately degenerates into a rout.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"However─",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"The warriors are already in place to cut off their escape route.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If you still have the wherewithal to flee, I'd rather you stay and keep us company a while longer.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“(Huh... Huuuuuh?!)”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Watching the battle from safety, Koyuzu is taken aback by the savagery displayed by Mutsumi and her warriors.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The young Koyuzu has never before witnessed the Shiseikan in battle.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Because of their reputation as “The Harmonious,” she had always assumed that House Sarashina had a similarly elegant fighting style.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"But the reality is different.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Since its very founding, House Sarashina's Shiseikan has always placed its fighting prowess in the field above all else.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"While they do not concern themselves with meaningless victories in the dojo, they show absolutely no quarter upon the battlefield itself.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"The only reason they developed a reputation as mediators among the Three Founders is simply because they have no interest in leadership.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh? I see our chairman has finally returned.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"As soon as we step outside, the stench of iron immediately pierces my nose.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"My first thought was that it's the blood of the warriors who were caught up in the explosion, but I swiftly realize my misapprehension.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"A closer look reveals the burned-out husks of Republican armored vehicles in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"As well as the corpses of countless enemy soldiers lining the cobblestones of the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The enemy is already here?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Chairman, how did you fare?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okonogi is dead.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now that is cause for celebration.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“How shall we proceed?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“After that last bombing run, it's unsafe to stay here any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We'll need to immediately neutralize the nearby Republican garrisons─”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Artillery incoming!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Take cover!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Koyuzu practically screams out her warning.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I pick up Akari and Kanami in my arms and leap into the palace at once.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Not a second later, the shells come raining down.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The ground churns as though it is a cauldron of fire.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The deafening rumbling drowns out the screams of all those who failed to take cover in time.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"─As soon as the bombardment ends, the enemy will be upon us.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"I squint out beyond the clouds of dust and debris in preparation for that moment.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Enemy armor approaching!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"As soon as the bombardment stops, it is replaced with the grinding sound of advancing tank treads.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tanks, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Anything on the ground is no match for our blades.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Chairman, allow us the honor of facing the oncoming enemy.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Rally the main unit to the rear gate and proceed to Iseya at once.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I shall stay and fight as well.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san nods with a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"It's the exact same smile she'd show you after taking your order at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Sentimentality between warriors has no place upon the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“We look forward to your patronage at Miyoshi for a grand feast celebrating our victory.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san turns to face the rapidly encroaching Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Good hunting, Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You too.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Koyuzu turns to face the enemy as well.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now then, shall we?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Let us give the Republicans a lesson on what a true warrior looks like.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, we're heading for Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would go anywhere so long as it's with you, Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The main unit will now make way for Iseya! Follow me!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"All of us fall in behind Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Just as we reach the rear gates, Kotone and several other priestesses come running from the direction of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah... haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My apologies... for holding you up...”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You caught up with us just in time. Did you find anything at the Barrier?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is, umm...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Kotone furtively glances at the priestesses behind her.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"They are considerably fewer in number from when we parted.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would appear that the Republican Army has a former priestess in their employ.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would be wise to be wary of enemy magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Kotone replies in a stiff, matter-of-fact manner.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"She must have witnessed a truly terrible sight at the Barrier, but now isn't the time to ask.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're heading for Iseya right now.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Of course. We shall accompany you.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is a priestess's duty to stay always by the warriors' side.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Think your legs can keep up?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-They absolutely will!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All right! Let's move!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"We resume our dash towards the gates.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Now, now, no need to rush.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"A mild, pleasant voice rings out─a voice wholly unbefitting the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"A single, uniformed soldier stands before us, blocking our path.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Won't you stay and chat with me for a bit?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I might not look like it, but I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" still a Republican soldier.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I can't exactly turn a blind eye to your little revolt, can I?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What can you hope to do all alone?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Well, well, what indeed?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"With a theatrical flourish, he raises his open palm.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"And with it, the vista before us shimmers like the haze of heat.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Suddenly, as though an invisible veil was lifted away, a battalion of Republican soldiers comes into view between us and Rochel.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"He hid his troops with magicks!",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Interposing myself in front of the defenseless girls, I deflect the oncoming bullets with my blade.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't move!”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Straining my senses to their limits, I continue swatting away the countless deadly projectiles.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Ordinarily, I might have let a shot or two slip past.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"But today is different.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Thanks to Kotone's talisman, I can clearly see the trajectory of each and every bullet.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, clear a path!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Got it!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Hotori positions herself behind me as the bullets barely whiz past her.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"And using my shoulders as a springboard, she leaps high into the air.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shiranui!”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Flames take youuu!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"A blazing dragon of flames devours the front lines of the enemy formation.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Noooow!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"We rush in headlong.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"So long as we can close the distance, the advantage is ours.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"I cut down the enemy soldiers one after another as they cower before Shiranui's flames.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh dearie me. After all the effort my subordinates went to in order to make this for me, I just had to go and botch it.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Well then, how about trying this on for size?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"The clarion sound of a bell echoes across the field.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"By all rights, the delicate sound of a single bell should have been lost amidst the clash of steel and the screams of men.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"And yet, its mellifluous ring burrows its way into my eardrums all the same.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gh!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Hotori's legs suddenly collapse beneath her.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"...Not just Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"One after another, my comrades in the Sworn Blades are brought to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What?! What's going on?!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Only Akari, Kanami, Kotone, and the other priestesses are unaffected.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"What magicks could have...?",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I've been told it's a spell that reacts only to warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Apparently it's a variation of the same magicks used to manipulate Hotori-san.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Rochel shows us a small, ceremonial bell used in the rites of priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Now then, gentlemen, here's your chance.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"The enemy soldiers ready their weapons.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"This is bad─",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Raaaaaaarrrrgghhh!”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"I desperately hurl a Sickle Leaf at the surrounding enemies.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"But even in the wake of the devastating shockwave, many of the enemy soldiers are still left standing.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"A deadly storm of steel falls upon my helpless comrades in arms.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"The warriors who were fighting alongside me mere moments ago are summarily rendered into silent corpses.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"It's nothing short of a massacre.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari?! Kanami?!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Kotone stands with her arms outstretched as the two cower behind her.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Innumerable bullets race towards them, but they all fall to the ground before Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Thank goodness─she managed to put up a Spellshield.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh my, unless my eyes deceive me, are you not the Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“An impressive display of magicks indeed, but how long will you be able to keep it up?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Rochel's lips twist into a sneer as he rings the bell once again.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I have to stop that thing somehow.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"The moment I begin to step forward─",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"A perfectly placed bullet shatters the Artifact into pieces.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh my, you of all people?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Rochel's eyes land on a point behind us.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now's your chance!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Raaaaarrgh!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You cowaaards!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Freed from their bindings, my comrades surge forward and join me in carving through the enemy ranks.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"We swing our blades with a never-before-seen ferocity, as though to vindicate our fallen friends.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Seems like it's getting to be about time.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Soujin, I pray that we'll meet again soon.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Their guns still pointed in our direction, Rochel's forces begin slowly beating a retreat.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Not on my watch─",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"I kick off from the ground and leap at Rochel from above.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"His eyes widen in astonishment.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Nice try.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh?!”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"A faint glint closes in from the very edge of my vision.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Not a second too late, I raise my guard on impulse─",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"And barely manage to parry the deadly strike, one that threatens to sunder my spellblade atwain with its overwhelming power.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"An intense numbness races up my arms.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hah...!”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"My breath catches in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"That silhouette... That bladework... There's no mistaking it.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Their owner, standing before me, could be none other than Inou Kokuan himself.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Well parried.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"A familiar, unhurried voice reaches my ears.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"I swallow hard to suppress the nostalgia welling up in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Even if it is Kokuan-dono, he who stands before us now is undoubtedly our enemy.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono... you were alive after all!”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"He offers no response.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Has my master no recollection of me?!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Uttering not one word in response, Kokuan-dono merely stands with his blade at the ready.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"He is not as he should be...",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Father?!”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Hotori cries out from behind me.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"She's already dispatched the remaining Republican soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori & Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you truly...” “Wait!”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Hotori's hair dances on the air.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"The moment she entered his one-step distance, Kokuan swung his blade.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Fa... ther?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Even faced with his own daughter, Kokuan-dono's expression does not change in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Only one shall face me.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“An unequal duel runs counter to the just path.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"He speaks just as the Kokuan-dono of the past would, yet he doesn't recognize us at all.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"What is the meaning of this?",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, Operation Bellflower... has failed.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republican Army has read our every move!”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Reinforcements will arrive at any second! Get out of Tenkyo while you still can!”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Elsa calls out from behind our backs.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you trying to help us?”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The last of my loyalty to the Republic went up in flames at Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Elsa's uniform is stained black with soot and ash.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"She must have been desperately running about as her own countrymen dropped bombs all around her.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What happened with Yogarasu District?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I couldn't do anything about the infrastructure, though I managed to keep the casualties to a minimum.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But that's beside the point. You need to retreat, now!”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“They just called in that Mutsumi's forces were completely neutralized.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"Was it due to the same Artifact from earlier?",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"No matter. As much as it pains me, Elsa is right. We absolutely do need to retreat.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"At present, there are only about ten of us still in any fighting condition.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Even if we manage to take Kanami to Iseya, we won't be able to accomplish anything with such few numbers.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, take Miyaguni and run.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We can't afford to lose you two here.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Hotori takes a single, determined step towards Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"If this really is him, then nobody but Hotori or I will stand a chance of defeating him.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Hence, none of the other warriors are willing to step forward.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're our chairman. Allow me.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okonogi said both you and Miyaguni are necessary for the restoration of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There must be some reason for that.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I'll be right behind you.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"With that, Hotori draws Shiranui.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Shiranui?”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“If the head of House Inou stands before me, thou mayst be a worthy foe indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"The ominous grinding sound of multiple approaching tanks draws closer and closer.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"There's no time to hesitate.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"I glance at Akari, and she gives only a firm, wordless nod.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Knowing that Hotori's decision is the correct one, she holds back all of her objections.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, I leave the rest to you.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"I leave Hotori behind and regroup with the few remaining survivors.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"All of them are bleeding, and in no small amount.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"Our meager forces are all that remains of a once proud army.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Everyone, let us make haste to the Imperial Temple.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have prepared an emergency escape route there.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We have no choice.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait!”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Akari turns to face Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami, you stay here at the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Whatever are you saying?!”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you come with us, you'll also be treated as a treasonist.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if you come with us to Iseya, we won't be able to establish a provisional government.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In which case, you have to stay here and survive.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you tell them the warriors tried to abduct you against your will, they shouldn't mistreat you.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you think, Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I agree. She'll be much safer here compared to running away as a fugitive.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I refuse to be separated from Onii─!”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Elsa grabs Kanami by the arms.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As the governor-general's daughter, I'll do everything in my power to keep you alive.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Spare me your concern!”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Try to understand. This is for your own safety.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I refuse to be separated from you, Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If she is to be apart from you, your Kanami has no reason to continue living!”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, won't you stay here for my sake?”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The more people I have to protect, the more likely it is I will fail in my duty.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't afford to die yet. Not while my lord's ambitions remain unfulfilled.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...!”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"It's unfair of me, and I feel pathetic for resorting to it.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"But if I put it this way, I know she'll have no choice but to accept it.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry... Please forgive me.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"Kanami grumbles a grudging acquiescence.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, I leave her to you.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“She's in good hands.”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"Elsa smiles a wide, reassuring smile.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami... Or rather, Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We shall return to Tenkyo someday. I swear it. Until then, please watch over the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"Kanami reluctantly bites her lip.",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"But even so, she shows Akari a silent nod.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's my sister.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, you have to stay alive.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I shall. Good fortune be upon you too, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"With one last smile to her, I turn my back on Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This way!”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Sworn Blades will now make for the Imperial Temple!”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Form ranks and clear a path!”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"At my side, Akari squeezes her eyes tightly shut.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"There is nothing more painful for a lord than to flee from a lost battle.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"─If only I'd not issued that fateful order, if only I'd devised a better strategy, if only I'd turned back before it was too late, if only...",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"All these regrets and more must be swirling around inside of her right now.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"But until all is said and done, she must not give them any voice.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"So long as her subjects still fight on, our lord must display the strength of will needed to see things through to the very end.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"That is the vow that she and I swore to each other.",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's get out of this alive.”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And let us see the Empire restored someday.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. We absolutely will!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
